                <mxCell id="37" value="• Frontend never holds AWS credentials&#10;• AI output is re-validated before any execute decision&#10;• execute maps to fixed AWS SDK calls — no shell,&#10;   so command injection is impossible by design&#10;• Only read-only allowlisted commands can run&#10;• Provisioned via AWS SAM / CloudFormation" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
